{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3072","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3072","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3072\",\"parent_revision\":\"a3c2dc85ef4fbd0c1fa6af6b87b3c5cf840a58e0\",\"root_revision\":\"1e2623816ec26a9d72b4ee87e8632d690ceb766cb992365a94f0c7547d5effeb\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Decision Needed\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nRecorded as open question 1 in `docs/agent-markdown-consumption-contract.md`, with no backlog\\ntracking until now \u2014 a decision left only in prose is not discoverable and does not block the\\nwork it should block.\\n\\nTwo related questions:\\n\\n1. What is the engine's default response budget, relative to the harness cap of ~10,000 tokens\\n   (R2)? The budget must not exceed the cap, but the cap leaves no margin for surrounding\\n   response envelope (metadata, hint text) if set equal to it.\\n2. Is there one configurable budget constant for every operation the contract binds (item read,\\n   plan read, task read, artifact read, listing embeds \u2014 see the contract's Scope section), or\\n   does each operation get its own? Three separate budget constants exist in code today\\n   (`_VIEW_TOKEN_BUDGET`, `_LIST_TOKEN_BUDGET`, `list_navigator.TOKEN_BUDGET`) \u2014 this decision\\n   determines whether that's a defect to consolidate or an intentional per-operation design.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Why This Blocks Work\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n#3057 and #3058 route additional operations through the markdown engine. Without this decision\\nthose operations have no defined budget to route against.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Resolution\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nUpdate `docs/agent-markdown-consumption-contract.md`'s open-questions section to remove item 1\\nonce decided, and record the chosen value/scope directly in the contract as a normative\\nrequirement.\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"281deaca8545f690b7ff58ec00404758a9a68286b5450fd1de2608325dcdc38e\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABP85HnQ\"}"}